{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-87021","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120878","text":"Workbench"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120879","text":"Crystallize agent behavior into replayable skills."}]}],"id":"blk-87022","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-87024","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120880","text":"A skill workshop and proof harness for the [&] Stack. Teach an agent once, capture every observable step, and turn the trace into a signed, replayable "},{"id":"spn-120881","marks":["bold"],"text":"SkillBundle"},{"id":"spn-120882","text":" that PRISM can score and that any [&] body (browser / host / simulator) can re-execute."}]},{"id":"blk-87025","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120883","text":"Why Workbench exists"}]},{"id":"blk-87026","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120884","text":"The [&] Stack has eleven protocols (OS-001..OS-011), nine MCP servers, and roughly five hundred Elixir / TypeScript tests showing the parts work in isolation. What it didn't have — until now — was a "},{"id":"spn-120885","marks":["italic"],"text":"user-facing"},{"id":"spn-120886","text":" artifact that exercises the whole pipeline and produces something a person actually wants. Workbench is that artifact."}]},{"id":"blk-87027","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120887","text":"A SkillBundle is valuable to the user (a reusable, replayable thing they can share). The same JSON is valuable to PRISM (it satisfies the EvidenceBundle contract from "},{"id":"spn-120888","marks":["code"],"text":"STACK_ARCHITECTURE_GAP_REVIEW.md"},{"id":"spn-120889","text":" Finding 8). Two audiences, one file."}]},{"id":"blk-87028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120890","text":"See "},{"id":"spn-120891","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/workbench/docs/spec/README.md"}],"text":"`docs/spec/README.md`"},{"id":"spn-120892","text":" for the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-87029","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120893","text":"Layout"}]},{"id":"blk-87030","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"workbench/\n├── docs/spec/                   # authoritative v0.1 spec + 6 JSON schemas\n├── fixtures/scenarios/          # 5 canonical fixture scenarios\n├── app/                         # SvelteKit static app (Cloudflare Pages)\n│   ├── src/lib/\n│   │   ├── types.ts             # TypeScript mirrors of every schema\n│   │   ├── hash.ts              # canonical JSON + sha256 + bundleContentHash\n│   │   ├── storage.ts           # IndexedDB + sessionStorage\n│   │   ├── openrouter.ts        # BYO-key chat client (via /api/llm/openrouter)\n│   │   ├── trace.ts             # InteractionTrace builder\n│   │   ├── mcp/                 # streamable-HTTP MCP client + per-server wrappers\n│   │   └── bundle/              # builder / verify / replay\n│   └── src/routes/              # +layout, +page (landing), teach, skills, compare, prism, import\n└── functions/\n    ├── llm/openrouter.ts        # CF Pages Function: OpenRouter pass-through\n    ├── mcp/                     # CF Pages Functions: delegatic / body-browser / prism MCP proxies\n    └── prism/leaderboard.ts     # CF Pages Function: PRISM read-only leaderboard proxy"},{"id":"blk-87031","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120894","text":"Status"}]},{"id":"blk-87032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120895","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.3.0-alpha"},{"id":"spn-120896","text":" — Invariant Arithmetic v0.3 is wired into the verifier and replay surface. Every proof gate's verdict is now computed by an "},{"id":"spn-120897","marks":["code"],"text":"InvariantArithmetic.consume(value, requirements)"},{"id":"spn-120898","text":" call ("},{"id":"spn-120899","marks":["code"],"text":"app/src/lib/ia/"},{"id":"spn-120900","text":"), and every gate carries "},{"id":"spn-120901","marks":["code"],"text":"law"},{"id":"spn-120902","text":" (e.g. "},{"id":"spn-120903","marks":["code"],"text":"'L12/L14'"},{"id":"spn-120904","text":") and "},{"id":"spn-120905","marks":["code"],"text":"invariant_family"},{"id":"spn-120906","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-120907","marks":["code"],"text":"topological | spatial | temporal | governance"},{"id":"spn-120908","text":") annotations. Replay surprise signals carry the same projection. The three relevant JSON schemas (PROOF_RESULT, REPLAY_REPORT, EVIDENCE_BUNDLE) declare the optional "},{"id":"spn-120909","marks":["code"],"text":"law"},{"id":"spn-120910","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-120911","marks":["code"],"text":"invariant_family"},{"id":"spn-120912","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-120913","marks":["code"],"text":"ia_substrate"},{"id":"spn-120914","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-120915","marks":["code"],"text":"invariants"},{"id":"spn-120916","text":" fields."}]},{"id":"blk-87033","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120917","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.2.3 baseline"},{"id":"spn-120918","text":" — authority gate supports "},{"id":"spn-120919","marks":["code"],"text":"delegatic-mcp"},{"id":"spn-120920","text":" HMAC/TTL verification when enabled, "},{"id":"spn-120921","marks":["code"],"text":"body-browser-mcp"},{"id":"spn-120922","text":" is wired for browser-body teach flows, and the PRISM page stages SkillBundle hand-off by "},{"id":"spn-120923","marks":["code"],"text":"content_hash"},{"id":"spn-120924","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120925","text":"Persisted bundles are now self-describing: "},{"id":"spn-120926","marks":["code"],"text":"verifyBundle"},{"id":"spn-120927","text":" returns an "},{"id":"spn-120928","marks":["code"],"text":"ia_substrate"},{"id":"spn-120929","text":" block (version + "},{"id":"spn-120930","marks":["code"],"text":"laws_exercised"},{"id":"spn-120931","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-120932","marks":["code"],"text":"families_exercised"},{"id":"spn-120933","text":" projected from the gates' annotations) which the teach flow stamps into "},{"id":"spn-120934","marks":["code"],"text":"bundle.proof.ia_substrate"},{"id":"spn-120935","text":" before re-sealing the "},{"id":"spn-120936","marks":["code"],"text":"content_hash"},{"id":"spn-120937","text":". The compare flow leaves it ephemeral (no persistence)."}]},{"id":"blk-87035","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120938","text":"113 / 113 vitest tests pass as of 2026-05-27 (95 v0.2 + 15 IA law properties at 1000 trials each + 3 IA annotation/substrate tests). "},{"id":"spn-120939","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run check"},{"id":"spn-120940","text":" has 23 known TypeScript/Svelte diagnostics inherited from v0.2.3 (no new diagnostics from the IA work); do not present the app as typecheck-clean until those are resolved."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-87037","spans":[{"id":"spn-120941","text":"Surface"}]},{"id":"blk-87038","spans":[{"id":"spn-120942","text":"Status"}]}],"id":"blk-87036","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-87039","spans":[{"id":"spn-120943","text":"JSON schemas (6)"}]},{"id":"blk-87040","spans":[{"id":"spn-120944","text":"✅ complete + IA-annotated"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87041","spans":[{"id":"spn-120945","text":"Fixture scenarios"}]},{"id":"blk-87042","spans":[{"id":"spn-120946","text":"✅ 5 / 5"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87043","spans":[{"id":"spn-120947","text":"SvelteKit app shell"}]},{"id":"blk-87044","spans":[{"id":"spn-120948","text":"✅ scaffolded"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87045","spans":[{"id":"spn-120949","text":"Teach (simulator)"}]},{"id":"blk-87046","spans":[{"id":"spn-120950","text":"✅ end-to-end"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87047","spans":[{"id":"spn-120951","text":"Fixture chooser"}]},{"id":"blk-87048","spans":[{"id":"spn-120952","text":"✅ 5 / 5 (AC #3)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87049","spans":[{"id":"spn-120953","text":"Crystallize bundle"}]},{"id":"blk-87050","spans":[{"id":"spn-120954","text":"✅ working"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87051","spans":[{"id":"spn-120955","text":"Bundle verify"}]},{"id":"blk-87052","spans":[{"id":"spn-120956","text":"✅ 6 / 6 gates, IA-derived (v0.3)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87053","spans":[{"id":"spn-120957","text":"Bundle replay"}]},{"id":"blk-87054","spans":[{"id":"spn-120958","text":"✅ deterministic, IA-annotated surprises (v0.3)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87055","spans":[{"id":"spn-120959","text":"Redaction profiles"}]},{"id":"blk-87056","spans":[{"id":"spn-120960","text":"✅ none / transcript_pii / full"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87057","spans":[{"id":"spn-120961","text":"Compare tab (2 models)"}]},{"id":"blk-87058","spans":[{"id":"spn-120962","text":"✅ AC #13 (live LLM)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87059","spans":[{"id":"spn-120963","text":"Live manifest validation"}]},{"id":"blk-87060","spans":[{"id":"spn-120964","text":"✅ AC #6"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87061","spans":[{"id":"spn-120965","text":"Cross-session re-import"}]},{"id":"blk-87062","spans":[{"id":"spn-120966","text":"✅ AC #8"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87063","spans":[{"id":"spn-120967","text":"Body-browser teach"}]},{"id":"blk-87064","spans":[{"id":"spn-120968","text":"✅ v0.2.2 (perceive + encode_state edges)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87065","spans":[{"id":"spn-120969","text":"Delegatic authority"}]},{"id":"blk-87066","spans":[{"id":"spn-120970","text":"✅ v0.2.1 (put_policy → authorize → verify)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87067","spans":[{"id":"spn-120971","text":"PRISM connectivity"}]},{"id":"blk-87068","spans":[{"id":"spn-120972","text":"✅ v0.2.3 (leaderboard + list_systems + bundle hand-off)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87069","spans":[{"id":"spn-120973","text":"Invariant Arithmetic"}]},{"id":"blk-87070","spans":[{"id":"spn-120974","text":"✅ v0.3.0 (15 laws, 1000-trial property tests, "},{"id":"spn-120975","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-120976","text":"-derived gates)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-87071","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120977","text":"Develop"}]},{"id":"blk-87072","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"cd app\nnpm install\nnpm run dev    # http://localhost:5180"},{"id":"blk-87073","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120978","text":"The dev server expects an OpenRouter key in "},{"id":"spn-120979","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionStorage"},{"id":"spn-120980","text":" (set via the landing page). For local development without a real proxy, set up a Vite middleware that forwards "},{"id":"spn-120981","marks":["code"],"text":"/api/llm/openrouter/*"},{"id":"spn-120982","text":" to "},{"id":"spn-120983","marks":["code"],"text":"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/*"},{"id":"spn-120984","text":", or configure Cloudflare's "},{"id":"spn-120985","marks":["code"],"text":"wrangler pages dev"},{"id":"spn-120986","text":" to mount "},{"id":"spn-120987","marks":["code"],"text":"functions/"},{"id":"spn-120988","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87074","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120989","text":"Deploy"}]},{"id":"blk-87075","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120990","text":"Cloudflare Pages, zero-budget tier. The static SvelteKit build lives under "},{"id":"spn-120991","marks":["code"],"text":"app/build/"},{"id":"spn-120992","text":"; the Pages Function under "},{"id":"spn-120993","marks":["code"],"text":"functions/"},{"id":"spn-120994","text":" is auto-discovered."}]},{"id":"blk-87076","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120995","text":"Specs that matter here"}]},{"id":"blk-87077","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87079","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120996","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-120997","text":" — Workbench v0.1 spec (authoritative)"}]}],"id":"blk-87078","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87081","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120998","marks":["code"],"text":"../AmpersandBoxDesign/SPEC.md"},{"id":"spn-120999","text":" — [&] Protocol"}]}],"id":"blk-87080","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87083","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121000","marks":["code"],"text":"../PULSE/schemas/pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-121001","text":" — PULSE manifests"}]}],"id":"blk-87082","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87085","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121002","marks":["code"],"text":"../PRISM/docs/"},{"id":"spn-121003","text":" — PRISM benchmark contract"}]}],"id":"blk-87084","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87087","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121004","marks":["code"],"text":"../STACK_ARCHITECTURE_GAP_REVIEW.md"},{"id":"spn-121005","text":" Finding 8 — the Evidence Bundle gap this closes"}]}],"id":"blk-87086","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierazfu7dl34ba7yoekvpp27ipuifumtkiw4ng5fp64v5ynipuuqgruq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}